ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Vaya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡El tiempo vuela!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mejor me voy ya a casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Pero tenemos que quedar
otro día, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Uau!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Il tempo è proprio volato!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ora però devo correre a casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Dovremmo vederci più spesso,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Vay!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Zaman nereye gidiyor böyle?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ben eve doğru koşsam iyi olacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ama yine takılalım,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Vaya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Llevo aquí un buen rato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Voy a llegar tarde a mis clases
de musculación!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Pero tu casa me gusta la tira!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Tenemos que quedar otro día,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Heeey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Gizlice kaçmaya mı çalışıyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Sen çıkıyorsan benim de gitmem iyi
olur, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Beni evinde ağırladığın için sağ ol, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
